e04a2d2a (12 1792957485195 "guenchi" (("4gm4c2jr" . 3240) ("w5vbequy" . 14982)) (put ((kind . section) (title . "landing f354") (src . "test: two context rows pin what a working answer reports and when it asks\n\nCW-4 compared a working answer's used tokens only against its budget and\nagainst the committed answer's used, so an answer reporting any number in\nbetween, its whole budget for one, kept the row green. The row now also\ncompares used, for both answers, with the size of what was rendered: the\nbytes received without the cut, in tokens of four bytes, as the\nincomplete-clause rows compare it.\n\nCW-13 is new: a block is drafted, then a decision it depends on is\ncommitted after the drafts' cut. The committed context places the\ndecision in constraints; the working answer, whose five hard queries are\nasked at the drafts' cut as its records are read, answers ok with the\nmarker, no constraints and the drafted text. Hard queries asked of the\nlatest state instead would name a block the records do not hold.\n\nBoth rows read red under one-line changes to context.sc that were green\nacross the whole fixture before.\n\n- test/context-verb.sc: CW-4's two comparisons, the CW-13 section.\n- test/rows-baseline.txt: context-verb 117 rows, 121 lines.\n") (parent . root) (ord . 482))))
